cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use trajectory-viz in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "trajectory-viz: Interactive visualization dashboard for agent-based mobility models"
abstract: >-
  A FastAPI + DuckDB + React + DeckGL + MapLibre dashboard for exploring
  trip and trajectory data emitted by agent-based mobility models. Designed
  around a declarative source registry (sources.yaml) so any ABM whose output
  can be expressed as trip and waypoint CSVs is supported via configuration,
  not code. Originally built against PFLOW (Pseudo-PFLOW Truck + Taxi ABMs)
  outputs (4.43M trips, 233M waypoints) at the University of Tokyo
  Sekimoto Lab / CSIS.
type: software
version: "0.2.0a1"
date-released: "2026-05-16"
authors:
